sequenceDiagram
  participant Host as Native or program caller
  participant Run as Invocation owner
  participant Src as Evidence owner
  participant Rules as Rule admission
  participant Sel as Selection owner
  participant Judge as Judgment owner
  participant HTTP as Jev adapter
  participant Policy as Policy interpreter
  Note over Host,Run: Proposed-only with no predecessor. Program facade owns framing
  Host->>Run: added typed skill-pack bindings, input paths, settings and cancellation
  Run->>Src: added capture rule/input bytes and optional comparison
  Src-->>Run: frozen snapshot or capture failure
  alt capture refused or aborted
    Run-->>Host: safe preparation failure or settled cancellation
  else capture admitted
    Run->>Rules: added preflight all captured JSONL/configuration
    Rules-->>Run: admitted packs or linked diagnostics
    alt invalid pack or configuration
      Run-->>Host: invalid invocation, no inference
    else admitted
      Run->>Sel: added before/current applicability, targets, context and definitions
      Sel->>Src: added query frozen sources
      Src-->>Sel: bundles, match sets or source diagnostics
      Sel-->>Run: every occurrence selected, skipped or failed
      Run->>Judge: added explicit named group and SkillRuleState
      Judge->>HTTP: added async request, finite settings and cancellation
      Note over HTTP: External inference may occur. Cancellation does not undo it
      HTTP-->>Judge: body or safe failure plus attempt observations
      alt response admitted and not aborted
        Judge-->>Run: completed answers, receipt and attempts
        Run->>Policy: added apply admitted rule data
        Policy-->>Run: source-linked finding
      else failure or abort
        Judge-->>Run: execution outcome and remote uncertainty, no finding
      end
      Note over Run: Stop new work on cancellation and join owned work before terminal result
      Run-->>Host: ordered report, coverage and measurements
    end
  end
